Z||000000||GT Bastard||04-30-2000||04:53 PM||||Just curious... Does anybody let their significant other drive their Fiero?  The first time I let my girlfriend drive my GT, she said: "The steering wheel is stuck. It won't move."  Actually, she's just a total wimp and never drove a car w/o power steering.  Generally, the idea of her driving my Fiero scares me.  I'd never let her take it without me in the car.  How bout you guys?||||reg||7
Z||000001||2birds||04-30-2000||05:08 PM||||I tried to teach my wife how to drive mine 11 years ago (5-speed).   She had never driven a manual before, and it seemed like every idiot with a horn got behind us as soon as she got behind the wheel.   Thought I'd have divorce papers waiting by the time we got home.  She had no problems in a Mustang or Conquest, but  a Fiero isn't the best choice for everyone to learn in.||||reg||1
