Z||000007||kevin||04-30-2000||11:18 PM||||I will not allow my wife to drive my precious road muffin for any reason whatsoever. I observed her emotional side in the past on the road while shifting her 5 speed Honda. Man what that scary!! Gals are just more prone to emotional irrationality than us guys.You just never know what would set them off. Do you know what I mean fellows? It has happened to all of us a few times in the past if we are honost. At the wheel of the car we all cherish, I can't immagine what might happen if she gets mad or vengeful at an unopportune time over a disagreement we had months before as she crosses a busy 4-way intersection. You never really know when gals can vent their frustrations. As such, I will never take the chance of letting her drive my 5-speed. The price is too great. A wrecked Fiero could be the genisis for a disalutionment. I rather keep my lovely wife and gorgeous car. Any comments?||||reg||1
