Z||000015||Uaana||05-01-2000||02:15 AM||||Ummm.<BR>No! Never again! <BR>I made the mistake of letting my GF use my GT twice (yes once was not enough) First time she came back and said it was running kind sluggish. (she had left the parking brake engaged, because it wasn't sticking up, and swears to this day the brake light wasn't on) Well me being the kind and forgiving person I am broke down a month or two later and let her use it again... So she proceeds to lock the keys in it while running and then tries everything in the book including letting some kid try and break the side window with a hammer to try and get back in, thankfully a kind passerby showed up and pried up the sunroof and popped the lock switch with a coat hanger.<BR>She is now happily driving her Dodge Stratus and swears never to touch my baby again.||||reg||13
